  "title": "Every Page and Field Configurator save deletes and re-inserts the type's Event Mapping, adding language rows with a blank language code",
  "statement": "On a re-save the configurator deletes every row of the configuration type's EOCC services on each content reference (DeleteUtilityServiceMapping order), each with a PSPTCSSRVCNFDEL tombstone at the next SCNFM, then inserts the rows it now derives. When the content reference's PSPTCS_SRVCFG already existed, each inserted row also gets a PSPTCSSRVCONFLG row whose LANGUAGE_CD is blank: the related-content API sets the language only on a new service.",
